<mxCell id="n1" value="BR63 defense: while a defense session is active, Approve / Reject are locked;&lt;br&gt;only Request revision is allowed (deadline ≥ 12 h before the defense).&lt;br&gt;Defense NO_SHOW rejects the proposal at once.&lt;br&gt;From Re-defense Pending the officer schedules a new defense (→ Under Review)&lt;br&gt;or may still decide directly." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1500" y="110" width="480" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n2" value="UC28 reschedule submits a new revision (an internal event without budget&lt;br&gt;goes straight back to Approved). If that revision is Rejected or Expired,&lt;br&gt;its registrations, bookings and budget are cancelled as in UC28 cancel;&lt;br&gt;the event keeps state Rejected / Expired." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1500" y="260" width="480" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
