<mxCell id="n1" value="DEFENDED keeps the session; the outcome is recorded by the next&lt;br&gt;UC26 decision: PASSED (approve), FAILED (reject),&lt;br&gt;REVISION_REQUIRED (request revision) or RE_DEFENSE (event →&lt;br&gt;Re-defense Pending; a new session is scheduled later).&lt;br&gt;Scheduler only alerts the club when a session is still unconfirmed&lt;br&gt;24 h before start; it does not change the state." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="420" width="420" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
